<div class="container layout-prose">
  <div class="flow max-prose">
    <h2 id="welcome">You belong here</h2>
    <p>Coming to Austin from another country to study social work takes courage, and it brings perspectives that make the whole School stronger. Whether you are settling in for your first semester, navigating immigration paperwork, planning a practicum or thinking about what comes after graduation, there are people on campus whose job is to help. OGE works alongside them, and we are glad to make an introduction whenever you are not sure where to start.</p>
    <p class="small muted">Immigration advising for F-1 and J-1 students and scholars is provided by Texas Global's International Student &amp; Scholar Services, not by the School. For time-sensitive immigration or travel questions, contact ISSS directly.</p>
  </div>
</div>

