        <p class="resource__text">Immigration advising, visa and status questions, travel signatures, work authorization and orientation for international students and visiting scholars.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Texas Global</span>
      </a>
      <a class="resource" href="https://global.utexas.edu/isss">
        <h3 class="resource__title">Interstride</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">A career and immigration-navigation platform for international students: job search tools that account for visa sponsorship, employer databases and guidance on working in the U.S. after graduation. UT students get access through Texas Global.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Texas Global</span>
