        <h3 class="resource__title">ATX Bridges</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">A community connection program that pairs international students with Austin community members for friendship, cultural exchange and a local welcome beyond campus.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Texas Global</span>
        <!-- VERIFY: ATX Bridges program URL; linking to Texas Global home as a fallback. -->
