        <p class="resource__text">Lauren Sanchez, LCSW, the Counselors in Academic Residence (CARE) counselor for the School, holds drop-in hours in Sutton Hall 2.126A on Wednesdays, 1–2 p.m., and Fridays, 11:30 a.m.–12:30 p.m. No appointment needed.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Steve Hicks School of Social Work · CMHC</span>
        <!-- VERIFY: CARE counselor page URL and current drop-in schedule. -->
