        <h3 class="resource__title">Counseling and Mental Health Center</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">Individual and group counseling, a 24/7 crisis line, workshops and support for students adjusting to life far from home.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">UT Austin Healthyhorns</span>
      </a>
      <a class="resource" href="https://socialwork.utexas.edu/dinitto-career-center/">
        <h3 class="resource__title">DiNitto Career Center</h3>
        <p class="resource__text">Career advising, résumé and licensure guidance, employer connections and job postings for social work students and alumni, including those planning careers outside the U.S.</p>
        <span class="resource__org">Steve Hicks School of Social Work</span>
