<section class="section" aria-labelledby="involved-title">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Get involved</p>
      <h2 id="involved-title">Your story is part of the School's global story</h2>
      <p>International students and scholars are not only the audience for global engagement; you are among its leaders. Many of the School's partnerships began with a student or visiting scholar who connected two communities.</p>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li><strong>Share your story.</strong> Tell us about your path to the School, your practicum or your research, and we may feature it in <a href="/stories/">Global Stories</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Join the listserv</strong> to hear about lectures, showcases and opportunities to meet visiting scholars from your region.</li>
        <li><strong>Help welcome the next cohort.</strong> Let us know if you would like to speak with incoming international students or at an orientation.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/connect/">Share your story</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/connect/listserv/">Join the listserv</a>
      </div>
